# Must stay consistent (make disjointness-check). ADR 0036 kept interventional
# and self-directed neuromodulation overlapping because some cases are both,
# such as paced-breathing guidance the individual follows; ADR 0068 made only
# neurostimulation disjoint with self-direction. If this fixture is ever
# rejected, that overlap has been closed by accident.
@prefix example: <https://example.org/sstim/disjointness-fixture/> .
@prefix sstim:   <https://w3id.org/sstim#> .

example:process a sstim:InterventionalNeuromodulation, sstim:SelfDirectedNeuromodulation .
